fedifeeds-info-announces:
Label on action=info of a page that is an item of a feed. Its value, {{msg-mw|fedifeeds-info-times}}, is how many Announces the notes of the page's items got from remote actors, across every feed.

See also:
* {{msg-mw|fedifeeds-info-likes}}

fedifeeds-info-likes:
Label on action=info of a page that is an item of a feed. Its value, {{msg-mw|fedifeeds-info-times}}, is how many Likes, emoji reactions included, the notes of the page's items got from remote actors, across every feed.

See also:
* {{msg-mw|fedifeeds-info-announces}}
